          "snippet": {
            "line": 260,
            "text": "theorem viewTangent_cross_zero (n : ℕ) {x : Point}\n    (hx : x ∈ (BaseContextAssembly.nativeStrip nominal standardRegion).domain)\n    {l m : Label B N0 × Fin 2} (hlm : l ≠ m) (Y : Plane) (theta : ℝ) (i : Fin 2) :\n    viewTangent n x l Y theta 0 * viewTangent n x m Y theta i.succ = 0"
          }
